# Test fixtures and conversion output.
#
# This repo has a collaborator, and the PDFs used as extraction fixtures are personal
# documents that live outside the tree. Nothing binary and nothing document-shaped is ever
# committed — tests that need a fixture either generate a synthetic PDF at test time or
# read a real one by absolute path from fixtures.local.json.
fixtures/
fixtures.local.json
*.pdf
*.epub

# Generated by scripts/sync-pdfjs-assets.mjs on predev/prebuild.
public/pdfjs/
.vercel
